# 90 Libraries & Integrations

How the installed packages are actually used here. Don't add new dependencies without proposing them first (see `00-project.mdc`). For library API details, use **Context7 MCP**.

## Queues & observability
- **laravel/horizon** — the only queue runtime that matters; all workers/queues are configured in `config/horizon.php` (12 supervisors, named queues). Add a supervisor when you add a queue (see `35-queues-jobs.mdc`). Dashboard gated by `viewHorizon` (Super Admin).
- **laravel/telescope** — local/admin debugging; gated by `viewTelescope` (Super Admin).
- **laravel/pulse** — app monitoring; `config/pulse.php`, gated by `viewPulse` (Super Admin).
- **sentry/sentry-laravel** — error reporting, wired in `bootstrap/app.php` (`Sentry\Laravel\Integration::handles`). Don't send secrets/PII into Sentry context.
- **laravel/nightwatch** — installed and auto-discovered; no explicit app code references.

## Auth, roles, access
- **spatie/laravel-permission** — roles only (no granular permissions in use). `User` uses `HasRoles`. Authorize via `hasRole()` + `role:` middleware + Gates. Config in `config/permission.php`.
- **pragmarx/google2fa-laravel** — 2FA enforced by the `2fa` middleware; guards profile and trader balance transfers. QR codes via **bacon/bacon-qr-code**.
- **lab404/laravel-impersonate** — Super Admin only; `auth.is_impersonated` is shared to the UI.
- **laravel/sanctum** — minimal: only a debug `GET /api/user`. The merchant API uses the custom `Access-Token` header instead (see `40-api.mdc`).
- **laravel/breeze** — auth scaffolding origin (login/2FA/logout in `routes/auth.php`; registration is disabled).

## API, idempotency, routing
- **square1/laravel-idempotency** — middleware aliases `idempotency` / `idempotency_for_app` exist (`config/idempotency.php`, header `Idempotency-Key`), but are **not attached to any route**; real dedup is `external_id` uniqueness. Don't assume it's active.
- **tightenco/ziggy** — exposes named routes to the frontend; regenerate with `php artisan ziggy:generate resources/js/ziggy-routes.js` after route changes (`config/ziggy.php`).

## Money, data, exports
- **ext-bcmath / ext-gmp** — required by `App\Services\Money\Money` arithmetic. Never use float for money.
- **maatwebsite/excel** — Excel exports in `app/Exports/*` (wallet transactions, trader/admin payouts).
- **propaganistas/laravel-phone**, **laravel-validation-rules/credit-card** — phone and card validation in requests (notably PaymentDetail).

## Telegram & content
- **irazasyed/telegram-bot-sdk** — Telegram bot, webhooks, and chat automation (`config/telegram.php`, `app/Telegram/*`, dispute notifications/automation; documented in `wiki/telegram/`).
- **ueberdosis/tiptap-php** + **@tiptap/* (frontend)** — rich text for news/editor content.

## External services (config/services.php)
- **deposit_provider** — external deposit provider (`base_url`, `api_key`, `webhook_key`, `merchant_id`); deposit/withdraw webhooks come in on dedicated token middleware.
- **ipgeolocation** — IP geolocation.

## Installed but effectively unused (don't build on these without checking)
- **socialiteproviders/telegram**, **socialiteproviders/zoho** (+ laravel/socialite) — present in composer, no OAuth flow wired in `app/`.
- **jenssegers/agent** — present; verify usage before relying on it.
- `App\Services\FundsHolder*` / `FundsOnHold` — code exists but is largely not wired into core order/payout flows.

## Frontend libraries
- **DaisyUI 5 + Tailwind v4** — all styling (theme `dim`); see `65-vue-conventions.mdc`.
- **pinia** — client state stores (`view`, `user`, `modal`, `tableFilters`).
- **echarts** v6 + **vue-echarts** — dashboard charts (via the shared `Components/Charts/DashboardChart.vue` wrapper). **pikaday** — date inputs in filters. **@vueuse/core**, **lodash**, **date-fns** (rarely), **sortablejs/vuedraggable** (ordering UIs), **tailwind-merge**, **vue-flagpack** (country flags), **vue-tg** (Telegram web app helpers).
